ted and that saves energy  joseph stodgel started the trash to  treasure festival  we're showing people how they can use  the great majority of everything they  throw away on a daily basis  to aid community resilience to grow food  to insulate their homes and a big part  of this is the eco brick this simple  technology of using a plastic bottle  stuffing your plastic trash into it and  and really sequestering that carbon that  would otherwise be released into the  environment  grayton has many plans for the future  but all the people here believe that in  the long term their town will no longer  be damaging the climate or the  environment  you
 

